<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:48:49 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Galatians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Ga-la-ti</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ga-la-ti</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt">Ga-la-ti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Phao-lô, muuyq dro jah rơơlh — leh truh xing koot manih, kung leh xing muuyq dro leq, bơh xing Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu ji xing Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq, Kơy heq khienq Kadraq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt — <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />kung dêq hloay khơl oh ay măn dii gô, atăq kaluh tayuup vah aduq Ga-la-ti: <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Apôôy vanong plêêk truh tol oh ay kung dii varơuq hrok hrol xing Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq, ji Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Kơy heq pahnăp xăk vii kadrôôp maroh haay, xôq Kadraq hnoq ik wơơt haay klơlh đơơy xanưm xơk aak juneq, tyauq xuum trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk, Vaq haay. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Apôôy tađnah tađnaak thuôk xuq Kadraq dong truh đơơy đơơy miet miet. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Gô dik akêh tuôôy oh ay thier dayh wih klơlh Kơy heq tawooyh taayh oh ay xing vanong plêêk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh xôq tyauq muuyq hêêl kaxay kadrơy, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />đơu Hêêl Kaxay yôôych be e đêh 'leq, vơ laa bơyh taleq dro hơq laa khơl adro dơơp xalôônq xalaaoq oh ay ji xung đnooy bơyq Hêêl Kaxay ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Bơh long ju hloay kaah 'wot, long muuyq yaak plêêk xing plêêk, đnooy vlôh ka oh ay muuyq hêêl kaxay đêh dii Hêêl Kaxay đơu 'wot heq đnooy vlôh ka oh ay, yôôych adro nưq pheq biq karoay axaap. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Đaji 'wot heq hmưq đnooy adroyq hơq, ji juneq gô đnooy yưk tra: “Atoh kơyq nưq đnooy vlôh ka oh ay muuyq hêêl kaxay đêh dii Hêêl Kaxay đơu oh ay heq tameng xok, yôôych adro nưq pheq biq karoay axaap.” <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Vii juneq, gô đong dơơp hlah xuum koot manih long laa Kơy Plêêk? Long e aalq gô axek trôôk dơơp hlah xuum khơl kadrơy? Atoh gô măn đong dơơp hlah xuum khơl kadrơy, yôôych kajưk dik gô leh aalq laa xapok ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Wơơy oh ay, gô xiin kahnoq ka oh ay xet truh Hêêl Kaxay heq jah gô đnooy vlôh, đaneq Hêêl Kaxay nưq be aalq laa gamưh tyauq muuyq dro leq. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Vii gô heq leh nhonq xok Hêêl Kaxay nưq xing muuyq dro leq, gô kung leh jah pato dayq, bơh nưq laa xing varơuq kahnoq vlôh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Vii oh ay heq tameng truh kach riirh tuôôy adroyq ku gô đom Jo Thaiq jaauq, nưq laa gô hmưq rôp toop thier ra ơơh tayuup vah ku Kơy Plêêk, ji kưq axek trôôk xôq păk kaxêêt tayuup nưq. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Ji gô hok hlolh xet đom Jo Thaiq jaauq galơh iaq 'ngưng dro kung xanưm raa đom khơl tamooy gô, tuôôy jêêk vlôh thier talăng jăk truh kaluh varơuq hnu hmeq ku mo kơy gô. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Bơh tuôôy Kơy Plêêk, Kơy heq rơơlh đêh gô xing đom klaak miq gô, ji heq tawooyh taayh gô xing vanong plêêk Kadraq, hlah xuum <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />kahnoq vlôh Koot Kadraq đom gô, xôq gô hnoq ik padoh taboon truh Koot nưq đom katul kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy, yôôych hloay jơnưq gô be tajauq dii hlek ji vahaap, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />gô kung leh hooy tok truh Jê-ru-sa-lem xôq tavơh khơl manih heq dơơp khơl jah rơơlh adroyq gô. Tađôôy muut đnư, gô heq hooy truh A-ra-bi, yôôch laay wiit xuq aduq Đa-mach.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Yôôch, atêq pe xanưm, gô hooy tok truh Jê-ru-sa-lem xôq dơơp qween dii Sê-pha ji măn hlê kung kơy nưq kưl dăp hngơy. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Bơh gô heq leh tavơh muuyq dro leq kadrơy đom khơl jah rơơlh, đêh vlôh Ja-kơ, dro ma oh kanau ku Lôôk. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Truh kaluh varơuq gô valơk ka oh ay, dayh 'yo đnen neq, kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, gô leh đnooy pa ôôh. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Atêq nưq, gô hooy truh kaluh dêh ku Si-ri ji Si-li-si. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Tuôôy nưq, gô măn koq lưp jah kaluh tayuup vah đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh aduq Ju-đê xet mot. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Bơh khơl tuôq 'miêh vơ tameng đaneq: “Adro adroyq hơq rôp toop haay juneq đong đnooy vlôh xuum tuôq đơu dro nưq hmưq axek trôôk păk kaxêêt,” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Lunưq oot vanê ayuôôt Kơy Plêêk vii kơq gô.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Atêq tuôôt kưl poot xanưm, gô laay hooy tok truh Jê-ru-sa-lem dii Ba-na-ba, tuôôy kung jarooy Tit kung hooy. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Tuôôy nưq, tyauq varơuq kahnoq vlôh, gô heq hooy tok ji đnooy padoh kangưưr oot Hêêl Kaxay đơu gô đnooy vlôh đom katul kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy, bơh tyauq kach đêh raa dii khơl adro e apok xarooy vado, leh kheoq kach leq nưq đơu gô đong charơơk long heq charơơk đom đaji hloh. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Ju đanưq, hloay kaah Tit, dro kung hooy dii gô, laa manih Hi Lap, kung leh biq băt pheq chiuq goch kađuh. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Đơu varơuq nưq laa xing khơl oh ay pa ôôh aluq muut , laa khơl adro heq aluq muut xôq tavooy 'yo varơuq rayơh rayơơy ku 'wot, laa rayơh rayơơy đơu 'wot e đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, xôq ka oot hnoq ik rôp 'wot dơơp xapok, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />lunưq 'wot kung heq leh dơơp varơuq chiuq nhương adroyq oot đom muuyq kawah takiêh leq, xôq varơuq dik ku Hêêl Kaxay hnoq ik măn miet dii oh ay. <verse eid="GAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Măn truh phon khơl adro e veeh laa e apok xarooy vado leq nưq (long adroyq hơq oot e laa băk leq, yôôych be dơơp vlôh varơuq đêh kajoq đôôyq dii gô; Kơy Plêêk leh 'yo nhonq aduq pi gôk ku koot manih) — dik, khơl dro dang đaji kôt galơh nưq be athêêp muut varơuq kajoq ka gô dêq. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Bơh wih hlê, tuôôy nhonq xet đaneq gô heq jah pahnăp varơuq đnooy vlôh Hêêl Kaxay deng ka manih koq chiuq goch kađuh, dang đaji Phi-e-rơ laa deng ka manih chiuq goch kađuh <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />(vii Kơy ahluk ahlul đom Phi-e-rơ xôq dưk dơơp chưk khơl jah rơơlh wih truh manih chiuq goch kađuh, kung ahluk ahlul đom gô wih truh manih tamooy kadrơy), <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />ji atêq tuôôy hlolh ik vanong plêêk heq jah kahniq ka gô, yôôych Ja-kơ, Sê-pha, ji Jăng, khơl manih dang đaji laa khơl dưk ưk, heq rôôp ti akoh anguk muuyq xuum dii Ba-na-ba ji gô, xôq 'wot yôôych wih truh kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy, măn oot wih truh khơl dro chiuq goch kađuh, <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />pato dăt đaneq 'wot duh văch truh manih adrah, jơq laa varơuq đơu gô kung heq dêq xuum dưk dơơp.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Bơh tuôôy Sê-pha hooy truh An-ti-ôt yôôych gô heq tachơơl hlê hloay kangưưr mot kơy vii kơy 'miêh đangq biq đnooy toah. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Vii adroyq tuôôy khơl manih xing Ja-kơ truh, kơy hmưq xa achung dii khơl dro tamooy kadrơy. Bơh tuôôy oot truh, kơy heq chuh klơlh ji klah kơy vlôh đêh, vii yôq taleq dro thuôk bing chiuq goch kađuh. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Ji khơl manih Jo Thaiq măn hlê kung nhôp bing kach pa ôôh tyauq kơy, pheq đnooy hloay kaah Ba-na-ba kung biq adô aluut tyauq katik xuum pa ôôh ku oot. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Bơh tuôôy gô hloq đaneq oot đong leh riirh hyioh jăk tyauq varơuq dik ku Hêêl Kaxay, gô heq đnooy dii Sê-pha kangưưr tôôy dro: “Atoh ay, laa manih Jo Thaiq, riirh đaji manih tamooy kadrơy đơu leh dang đaji manih Jo Thaiq, yôôych dơơp aleq ay hnoq ik băt manih tamooy kadrơy pheq riirh dang manih Jo Thaiq?” <verse eid="GAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />'Wot laa manih Jo Thaiq xing tuôôy pa iir vlôh, bơh be aalq manih kadrôôp vlôh xing manih daak kadrơy; <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />bơh vii xet đaneq be muuyq dro leq jah xưng hyioh jăk gamưh varơuq dơơp tyauq ganuun, đêh vlôh laa gamưh xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, lunưq 'wot heq xôq xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, xôq 'wot jah xưng hyioh jăk gamưh xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đơu leh aalq gamưh varơuq dơơp tyauq ganuun. Vii tôôy xăk xamơk hnoq leh jah xưng hyioh jăk xing varơuq dơơp tyauq ganuun. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Bơh atoh, đong tuôôy axek trôôk jah xưng hyioh jăk đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, kadih 'wot kung biq 'yo hloq laa manih e kadrôôp, yôôych jơq be Lôôk Wơơt Dêh laa manih hơu varơuq ka kadrôôp maroh? Varơuq nưq laa leh e yôôch! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Vii atoh gô dơơp hlê kaluh varơuq đơu gô heq pahyaak ka'lăk, yôôych gô ăm hloq gô laa adro lôp ganuun. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Vii gamưh hlê ganuun, gô heq kaxêêt đôôyq dii ganuun, xôq gô hnoq ik riirh ka Kơy Plêêk. Gô heq biq đongq đing muut gay charăk dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />long gô leh măn riirh đnoyq, bơh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh riirh đom gô. Măn đơơy riirh đơu gô măn đong riirh đom xăk xamơk, yôôych gô riirh đom xuum tuôq aduq Koot Kơy Plêêk, Kơy heq xiaq gô ji pahnăp kadih xăk Kadraq thay ka gô. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Gô leh chôôyq ka'lăk vanong kaxay ku Kơy Plêêk 'leq, vii atoh varơuq hyioh jăk laa bơyh ganuun, anưq yôôych Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq kaxêêt kach đaji hloh!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Wơơy, khơl manih Ga-la-ti vlô khưrq! Kơyq heq iêmh buua oh ay, tuôôy đơu kangưưr mot oh ay, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu chiuq đongq đing tol gay charăk heq padoh vlôh kach kahnoq hlolh? <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Gô vơ xung axek hlolh varơuq neq xing oh ay: Oh ay heq nhonq jah Kơy Phool Hiel xing varơuq dơơp tyauq ganuun long xing varơuq tameng tyauq đom xuum tuôq? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Oh ay vlô khưrq đanưq ih? Tuôôy heq xarôp bơơn Kơy Phool Hiel, jơq be juneq oh ay đong payôôch bơơn xăk xamơk? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />E jơq oh ay heq chiuq xet taleq pơơl hwơơl xôq be jah kajoq? — atoh dik anưq yôôych dik laa đaji hloh! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Anưq, Kơy kahniq Kơy Phool Hiel ka oh ay ji dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq taay yaak đom katul oh ay, nưq laa bơyh varơuq dơơp tyauq ganuun, long bơyh varơuq tameng tyauq đom xuum tuôq? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Đaji Ap-ra-ham “tuôq gamưh Kơy Plêêk ji nưq laa varơuq xôq kơy jah 'yo laa hyioh jăk,” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />anưq yôôych pheq hlolh đaneq khơl leq e xuum tuôq, nưq laa koot ku Ap-ra-ham. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Bơh tuôôy hloq adroyq đaneq Kơy Plêêk xưng manih daak kadrơy laa hyioh jăk vii xuum tuôq, yôôych Rahlăp Vah heq pato dayq Hêêl Kaxay adroyq ka Ap-ra-ham đaneq: “Tôôy tamooy hnoq jah vanong aduq koot.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Lunưq, kơyq e xuum tuôq yôôych jah vanong kung dii Ap-ra-ham, manih e xuum tuôq. <verse eid="GAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Xet taleq manih gamưh muut varơuq dơơp tyauq ganuun yôôych măn 'laarq apok karoay axaap; vii e valơk đaneq: “Đangq karoay axaap tôôy adro leh kajưk xuum dii tôôy varơuq jah valơk đom rahlăp ganuun xôq dưk dơơp ni.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Bơh ro raang đaneq be e kơyq gamưh ganuun jah xưng hyioh jăk kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, vii “manih hyioh jăk hnoq riirh bơyh xuum tuôq.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Măn ganuun yôôych leh vlôh xing xuum tuôq, bơh “Manih dơơp kaluh varơuq ku ganuun hnoq riirh gamưh ni.” <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq root haay klơlh varơuq karoay axaap ku ganuun tuôôy chiuq karoay axaap thêq ka haay — vii e apok valơk: “Đangq karoay axaap adro leq biq kađnok tol gay charăk” — <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />xôq vanong kaxay ku Ap-ra-ham truh dii manih tamooy kadrơy đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, xôq ka haay hnoq ik nhonq jah apok tavek truh Kơy Phool Hiel gamưh xuum tuôq.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Wơơy oh ay, gô đnooy tyauq kach koot manih. Ju đaleq, be ekơyq hnoq ik pahyaak ka'lăk long athêêp muut tavek heq jah khơl drơy dơơp vlôh. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Panưh kadrơy, kaluh apok tavek yôôych heq jah xanoh dii Ap-ra-ham ji ka koot xau ku kơy. Apok nưq leh đnooy “ji ka khơl koot xau” đaji pato truh 'ngưng manih, bơh laa “ji ka koot xau ku koot” đaji pato truh muuyq dro, đơu nưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Bơh truh varơuq gô xung đnooy nưq laa: Tuôôy e atêq poot hreek pe kưl xanưm, ganuun leh pahyaak ka'lăk tavek heq jah Kơy Plêêk dơơp vlôh adroyq nưq xôq dơơp paq ik xung liq apok tavek. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Vii atoh kơ ngiip truh xing ganuun, yôôych kơ ngiip nưq paq măn laa xing apok tavek. Bơh Kơy Plêêk heq kahniq vanong ka Ap-ra-ham gamưh hlê apok tavek. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Anưq yôôych, ganuun xôq dơơp kajoq? Ganuun heq jah athêêp muut vii kơq kaluh varơuq gưlh lôp, atêq tuôôy jah kahniq ăm xing khơl yaak plêêk gamưh ti ku muuyq manih măn katul, dong truh tuôôy leq koot xau heq truh, đơu apok tavek heq jah dơơp vlôh truh koot xau nưq. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Bơh manih măn katul yôôych leh deng ka muuyq panưh, đơu Kơy Plêêk yôôych e muuyq. <verse eid="GAL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Anưq, ganuun hooy kaxơơlh hlê apok tavek ih? Varơuq nưq laa leh e đanưq! Vii atoh ganuun jah kahniq ăm đơu hnoq ik taway hlê varơuq riirh, yôôych kajưk dik varơuq hyioh jăk dong dik truh xing ganuun. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Bơh Rahlăp Vah heq karuk jư dêq hloay 'laarq kadrôôp maroh xôq bơyh xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, apok tavek hnoq ik kahniq ka khơl manih e xuum tuôq.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Anưq bơh, adroyq katuôôy xuum tuôq nưq truh, haay 'miêh biq karuk jư 'laarq ganuun, tuôôy biq karuk dong truh tuôôy xuum tuôq jah kahnoq vlôh. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Pheq đnooy, ganuun heq jêêk vlôh manih pato jarooy ku haay wih truh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, xôq haay hnoq ik xưng hyioh jăk xing xuum tuôq. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Bơh atêq tuôôy xuum tuôq truh, haay paq măn ka'laalq manih pato jarooy đnoyq. <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Vii dêq hloay oh ay laa koot ku Kơy Plêêk gamưh xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Vii atoh khơl dro heq chiuq bap-tem đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh yôôych raay hlưp xok Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Leh măn kahra vlôh Jo Thaiq long Hi Lap, paq măn kahra vlôh xapok long rayơh rayơơy, paq măn kahra vlôh khơl kanau long khơl kadrê, vii dêq hloay oh ay laa muuyq đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Đơu atoh oh ay laa thuôk Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, yôôych oh ay laa koot xau ku Ap-ra-ham, laa khơl dro dưk katôôl tyauq apok tavek.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Bơh gô xung đnooy đaneq ka truh dong leq manih dưk katôôl măn laa oh de, yôôych adro nưq be đêh kajoq muuyq xapok, ju laa kôôch ku dêq hloay garuh anôôp. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Wih hlê, dro nưq măn 'laarq khơl manih pato jarooy ji khơl jư 'yo hnhư dong truh kawat heq đinq adroyq ku manih vaq. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Kung muuyq đanưq, tuôôy haay măn laa oh de, haay biq dơơp xapok ka kaluh qwuyen lưk thiêêng liêng ku dêh araak. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Bơh tuôôy jah xaleep ku hngơy kawat heq truh, Kơy Plêêk heq patăk dăt Koot Kadraq, tuôôy pa iir vlôh xing muuyq adro khơl drê, pa iir vlôh 'laarq ganuun, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />xôq Kadraq wơơt xok khơl adro măn 'laarq ganuun, xôq ka haay hnoq ik nhonq jah qwuyen dơơp koot văch. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Mot kadrơy, vii oh ay laa koot, lunưq Kơy Plêêk heq patăk Kơy Phool Hiel ku Koot Kadraq muut xuum haay, taayh kalh đaneq: “A-ba, Vaq.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Kơq nưq, oh ay paq măn laa xapok đnoyq, bơh laa koot, đơu atoh laa koot, yôôych kung laa dro dưk katôôl gamưh Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Bơh tuôôy adroyq, tuôôy koq lưp xet Kơy Plêêk, oh ay heq biq xapok ka kaluh thưq đơu dong dik be aalq laa yaak kajoq dêq. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Măn juneq tuôôy heq 'yo xet Kơy Plêêk, đơu jơq iaq laa heq jah Kơy Plêêk xet truh, yôôych dơơp aleq oh ay laay wiit xuq dii kaluh qwuyen lưk thiêêng liêng ravoch ji leh ik xung liq, oh ay ưng trôôch dơơp xapok ka ni athêêp muuyq yưk tra ih? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Oh ay kung măn 'yo hngơy, xiêk, muua ji xanưm! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Gô lo yôq ka oh ay, leh kheoq đaleq gô heq galeh galal kach đaji hloh đom katul oh ay.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Wơơy oh ay, gô xiin oh ay dayh jêêk vlôh dang đaji gô, vii gô kung đaji oh ay. Oh ay be dơơp ra ơơh gô muuyq xit leq. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Oh ay xet đaneq gamưh hlê varơuq jiq jiêh đom xăk xamơk neq, gô heq đnooy vlôh Hêêl Kaxay ka oh ay yưk adroyq dik. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Vii varơuq thưh thek tol oh ay aduq ka varơuq xăk xamơk gô, oh ay heq be 'yo leh ra kajoq, kung leh chôôyq ka'lăk, wih hlê, oh ay heq đoonq tiip gô đaji yaak plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk, đaji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Anưq yôôych, xuum hlah hlaak nưq ku oh ay ka'leq yôôch? Vii gô dơơp xanưk ka oh ay đaneq, atoh hnoq ik, oh ay dik heq galek mot ku oh ay, ăm hloh ka gô. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Anưq laa, gô heq jêêk vlôh adro tachơơl ku oh ay vii đnooy varơuq dik ka oh ay ih? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Khơl adro nưq talăng jăk dii oh ay, be aalq e xuum kaxay, bơh oot xung aklah đêh oh ay vlôh, xôq oh ay talăng jăk dii oot. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Bơh chiuq talăng jăk đom tôôy katuôôy ka varơuq kaxay yôôych tolh, ji leh aalq vơ tuôôy gô e mot dii oh ay. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Khơl koot ku gô lơơy, vii khơl koot đơu gô đong chiuq đơơt jiq pa iir yưk tra dong truh tuôôy Lôôk Wơơt Dêh jah jêêk yuôôr đom khơl koot — <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />mot kadrơy, gô trôôch kajoq măn jeq dii khơl koot hloay juneq ji tađôôy 'meq xarooy athêêk ku gô, vii gô đong xôôl dôôl truh khơl koot.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Nee khơl dro trôôch măn 'laarq ganuun, dayh ăm gô xet, oh ay leh chiuq tameng ganuun ih? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Vii e apok valơk đaneq Ap-ra-ham e vaarq koot kanau, muuyq laa bơyh mư kadrê xapok, ji muuyq laa bơyh mư kadrê rayơh rayơơy. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Lunư, adro koot xing mư kadrê xapok jah pa iir vlôh tyauq xăk xamơk, măn adro koot xing mư kadrê rayơh rayơơy jah pa iir vlôh xing apok tavek. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Kaluh varơuq neq yôôych jah đnooy truh đaji muuyq atoh, vii vaarq adro khơl kadrê nưq laa vaarq apok tavek. Muuyq apok tavek aduq đoot Si-nai, pa iir koot vlôh dơơp xapok. Nưq laa A-ga. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />A-ga laa đoot Si-nai aduq A-ra-bi, ji dang đaji dii theng Jê-ru-sa-lem juneq, vii theng nưq kung dii koot xau ni đong dơơp xapok. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Bơh Jê-ru-sa-lem măn tol plêêk yôôych rayơh rayơơy, đơu nưq laa miq ku haay. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Vii e apok valơk:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">“Dayh hlah hlaak, wơơy manih biq thoon, laa adro kadrê leh pa iir;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Dayh tok apok tok ji kacheeu hlah hlaak, wơơy adro leh jiq jiêh vii pa iir koot;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Vii koot xau ku adro kadrê biq ka'lăk 'ngưng iaq koot xau ku adro kadrê e kanau.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Wơơy oh ay, dang đaji I-sak, oh ay laa koot ku apok tavek. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Lunư, dang đaji katuôôy hnu, adro koot jah pa iir vlôh tyauq xăk xamơk rôp toop adro koot tyauq Kơy Phool Hiel đaleq, yôôych juneq kung đanưq. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Bơh Rahlăp Vah đnooy kajoq? “Dayh pađuôôy mư kadrê xapok ji koot ku mư. Vii koot ku mư kadrê xapok kajưk dik hnoq leh jah katôôl kung dii koot ku mư kadrê rayơh rayơơy.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Vii anưq, wơơy oh ay, haay lưp aalq laa koot ku mư kadrê xapok, bơh laa koot ku mư kadrê rayơh rayơơy.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq wơơt xaloot haay xôq jah rayơh rayơơy. Vii anưq, dayh dưk kajưk ji te chiuq pơq xok varaq xapok đnoyq.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Xiin dayh tabông, gô, Phao-lô, đnooy dii oh ay đaneq atoh oh ay duh chiuq goch kađuh, yôôych Lôôk Wơơt Dêh hnoq be taway ich lơơy kajoq ka oh ay dêq. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Gô đnooy kajưk yưk tra dii tôôy muuyq dro chiuq goch kađuh đaneq adro nưq băt pheq tameng jư dêq hloay ganuun. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Oh ay leq trôôch jah xưng hyioh jăk bơyh ganuun yôôych heq biq goch ka'lăk klơlh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, heq vlôh klơlh vanong plêêk. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Măn phon haay, gamưh Kơy Phool Hiel, bơyh xuum tuôq, haay ra uk ra aar takôô xuum takôô gamưh truh varơuq hyioh jăk. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Vii đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, varơuq 'yo duh be aalq laa goch kađuh long leh goch kađuh, đơu laa xuum tuôq jah dưk dơơp gamưh xuum xung xiaq. <verse eid="GAL 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Oh ay 'miêh đong charơơk tolh. Kơyq heq klơl đơ oh ay xôq leh jah tameng tyauq hyioh jăk? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Varơuq patuut ahluk nưq be truh xing Kơy tawooyh taayh oh ay! <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Muuyq takiêh tape dơơp vôô tok dêq đum bôôt. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Đom Lôôk, gô e xuum tuôq kajưk truh oh ay, đaneq oh ay hnoq leh biit đêh 'leq. Mot kadrơy, adro leq dơơp xôôl dôôl xuum biit oh ay hnoq chiuq hmơt dook, ju paq kê adro nưq laa kơyq. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Bơh, wơơy oh ay, atoh đaji gô măn padoh taboon pheep goch kađuh yôôych vii aleq gô măn biq rôp toop? Atoh anưq yôôych varơuq gưlh lôp vii kơq gay charăk heq jah deep ka'lăk yôôch. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Gô pheq đnooy trôôch khơl adro dơơp paloanq oh ay hnoq kadih thienq oot dơyh.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Wơơy oh ay, vii oh ay heq jah tawooyh taayh truh varơuq rayơh rayơơy, vơ laa varơuq rayơh rayơơy leh aalq xôq taway hlê kawah ka varơuq katik xăk xamơk, tađôôy muut đnư, dayh hơu varơuq mamuuyq bơyh xuum xung xiaq. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Vii dêq hloay ganuun jah dơơp xaleep đom muuyq apok tanưưl: “Koot pheq xung xiaq manih gah gih koot đaji xăk koot.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Măn atoh oh ay kek chieh ji xaluôt mamuuyq, yôôych dayh rơơt rol, leh kheoq oh ay păk kaxêêt mamuuyq.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Wih hlê, gô đnooy đaneq, dayh tawaak hooy tyauq Kơy Phool hiel, yôôych oh ay kajưk dik leh dơơp xaleep kaluh hmưch trôôch ku xăk xamơk. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Vii xăk xamơk hmưch trôôch đêh dii Kơy Phool Hiel, măn Kơy Phool Hiel đêh dii xăk xamơk. Vii vaarq panưh tachơơl dii mamuuyq, vii anưq leh e varơuq long oh ay trôôch kaluh varơuq neq, yôôych kưq dơơp. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Bơh atoh oh ay jah Lôôk Phool Hiel jarooy pato, yôôych oh ay leh măn 'laarq ganuun. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Kaluh varơuq dơơp ku xăk xamơk laa ro raang, kaluh nưq laa: varơuq apuq atrăp, klơơr 'yêq, xa agưt bơyq ba, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />akuh vangưl, đơơp pheep, tachơơl mamuuyq, tagoa tayaat, 'yarơ, tôq jaraq, takhuk tayaat, leh tagu, bing ja, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />'yarơ geet, vuul weel, trôôch xa hôôch kung kaluh kajoq dang đaji kaluh varơuq nưq, đơu truh varơuq nưq, gô đnooy panhăk ka oh ay, đaji gô heq đnooy panhăk adroyq neq, đaneq khơl leq dơơp kaluh varơuq đanưq hnoq leh nhonq jah ik daak dêh Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="GAL 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Bơh play ku Kơy Phool Hiel laa xuum xung xiaq, hlah hlaak, hrok hrol, atuq xuum, be huq, xuum kaxay, muuyq xuum, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />hien tamaq, jư xăk; be e ganuun leq tachơơl hlê dii kaluh varơuq đanưq. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Mot kadrơy, khơl dro thuôk xuq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu heq đongq đing varơuq katik xăk xamơk kung dii kaluh xuum trôôch ji hmưch trôôch tol gay charăk.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Atoh haay riirh gamưh Kơy Phool Hiel, yôôych haay kung duh tawaak hooy tyauq Kơy Phool Hiel. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Te vlôh jêêk apok pa ôôh tuôôy tache jaraq mamuuyq, 'yarơ mamuuyq.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Wơơy oh ay, atoh muuyq dro biq jah tavơh đom lôp kadrôôp leq, yôôych oh ay laa dro e Kơy Phool Hiel dayh 'meq hlê manih nưq đom xuum klaak be huq, tuôôy kadih 'yo rơơt kadih xăk, leh kheoq oh ay kung biq adô aluut. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Dayh pơq parêq ka mamuuyq, ji đanưq oh ay hnoq dơơp xaleep ganuun ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Vii atoh kơyq biit ni laa muuyq băk leq nưq, đom tuôôy be laa kajoq dêq, yôôych dro nưq kadih aluut pa ôôh ni. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Bơh tôôy muuyq dro pheq 'yo hlê varơuq dơơp ni, yôôch tuôôy nưq dro nưq hnoq e kơq xôq pa ưưt vlôh truh đêh ni, đơu leh aalq taso dii muuyq dro leq. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Vii tôôy muuyq dro hnoq pơq parêq ku kadih ni.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Mot kadrơy, manih jah pato đaauq pheq ahlook đom tôôy vâk tolh dii dro pato dayq ni. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Te xôq biq adô aluut. Kơy Plêêk leh chiuq agưt chok 'leq, vii atoh kơyq paraay kajoq yôôych hnoq goch đanưq. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Adro paraay ka xăk xamơk ni hnoq xing xăk xamơk goch xok varơuq kaxêêt hlơơp. Măn dro paraay ka Kơy Phool Hiel hnoq xing Kơy Phool Hiel goch xok varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Haay te liq galeh galal tuôôy dơơp varơuq kaxay, vii truh klip kawat, haay hnoq goch xok raak play atoh leh gưlh xuum. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Vii anưq, đom tuôôy haay e kawah, yôôych haay duh dơơp varơuq kaxay ka tôôy dro, đơu duh nhưk laa ka khơl dro đom kôôch hnhư xuum tuôq.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Dayh 'yo kaluh chư kôt xet toleq đơu gô heq valơk ka oh ay bơơn kadih ti gô. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />E 'ngưng adro trôôch dơơp rêêk tolh đom xăk xamơk, oot băt oh ay chiuq goch kađuh, vơ xôq oot klơlh pheq biq rôp toop truh gay charăk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Vii pheq đnooy jơq khơl adro chiuq goch kađuh nưq kung be tameng jư ganuun, bơh oot trôôch oh ay chiuq goch kađuh xôq oot hnoq ik pa ưưt akhwoak đom xăk xamơk ku oh ay. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Măn đôôyq dii gô, apôôy be e varơuq kajoq jêêk vlôh kơq xôq khwoe khwoak đêh vlôh truh gay charăk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay, bơyh gay charăk nưq, dêh araak đôôyq dii gô heq biq đongq đing, ji gô đôôyq dii dêh araak kung anưq. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Vii leh aalq varơuq goch kađuh laa varơuq duh kajoq, kung be aalq varơuq leh goch kađuh, bơh duh dik laa muuyq koot manih đơơu. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Ji atoh dêq hloay kơyq hnoq tawaak hooy tyauq trôôk pato neq, yôôych apôôy hrok hrol ji varơuq angơuq măn tol oot, ji tol manih I-sơ-ra-ên ku Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Xing neng kơn atêq, xiin te kơyq dơơp pơơl ka gô, vii gô đong pơq tol xăk gô kaluh hlêêl dơuq ku Lôôk Jê-xu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Wơơy oh ay, apôôy vanong plêêk ku Lôôk haay, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu măn kung danưng kooy oh ay. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>